2. By way of this petition the following orders have been  sought by the applicant-wife:
 a. The protection orders u/s 18 of the Act, 2005;
 b. The residence orders u/s 19 of the Act, 2005;
 c. The monetary relief u/s 20 of the Act, 2005;
 d. The compensation and damages u/s 22 of the Act,
 2005;
 2  e. The interim order u/s 23 of the Act, 2005; and  f. such interim order or orders as deemed fit just  and proper in the circumstances of the case.

The complainant-wife has specifically asked for the following  monetary relief(s):
 a. Rs.20,00000/- (Rupees Twenty Lac) on account  of loss of earnings;
 b. Rs.10,000/- (Rupees Ten Thousand) per month  towards the medical expenses;
 c. Rs.10,000/- (Rupees Ten Thousand) per month towards  the expenses of food, clothing, medication etc,;
 d. Rs.20,000/- (Rupees Twenty Thousand) per month  towards the household expenses; and  e. Rs.30,00,000/- (Rupees Thirty Lac) Thousand) towards  the destruction, damage or removal of the any  property from the control of the aggrieved person.
